    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": ", , ",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I'ma travel the globe, you keep the block hot",
          "rhyme": "Ot",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Driver, open the door for me, my hand hurt",
          "rhyme": "uRt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Find us, we playin' hide-and-seek with the passports",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Where the fuck we at? Oh, the pilot gotta remind us, yeah",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "The luggage is pilin', I needed clothes to wear (Woo)",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "So many stinkies sit in my wallet, look like a folding chair (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "The Cartier so light on my body, thought I floated here",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "We boated here, it's Tunechi and Tyler, but call me Baudelaire, yeah",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Out in Switzerland, travel with my bitch again, we kissin', dawg",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I love when she let me rub her like Michelin (Skrrt, skrrt, facts)",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "A hundred grand to sleep on the bird, the wings are whistlin' like—",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Man, they ain't listenin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "We crossed the line like immigrants and benefit from it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Keep on stuntin' on these niggas, make 'em sick to they stomach, man (I can't stop it)",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Y'all don't understand, fish so fresh that you could taste the sand",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Yeah, we gettin' lost but we know who we am (True story)",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Bada-bada-bada, somethin'-somethin'-somethin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Treat that last part like you niggas ain't sayin' nothin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEEFDGHIHJKKLMM",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABACCCDCEFCFEGGEEE"
