      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Excuse me, pardon me, the wind, it blow so hard at me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Like mother nature arguing about some baby father beef",
          "rhyme": "if",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And I'm stuck in the middle of the sandwich like slaughter meat",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Got my middle fingers to the cameras that's recording me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "From y'all to me, brrt, stop callin' me unless you're ordering",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I'm on the beach, I got my feet out, and I stay on my feet",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "The corner beat, I'm on a deep route, just throw the ball to me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Thought all this lean would have me senile, I guess they see now",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Let's touch down, catch a beat-down like I catch touchdowns",
          "rhyme": "un",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I fuck 'round and slow the beat down and take the drums out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "And speed up my flow, I'm so greedy, I'ma eat my own flow",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "And I'm in need of a flow, might eat me a rapper and I might as well eat me a ho (Oh)",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "I'm hot as hell when the weather is freezin', as cold as the devil and demon and ghost",
          "rhyme": "Ost",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "I'ma get even and even, get even some more, it's too late to even get low, baow",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Wolf Gang, Wolf Gang, that's what I need you to know, Mula, Weezy the G.O.A.T.",
          "rhyme": "t",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "The wind beneath my wings, Desert Eagle underneath my coat",
          "rhyme": "Owt",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, Mula (Bitch)",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        }
      ],
